{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1495172-scion-god-crowdfunding-now-live-on-backerkit","id":1495172,"title":"Scion: God crowdfunding now live on Backerkit!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-18T10:47:16-07:00","id":1495172,"title":"Scion: God crowdfunding now live on Backerkit!","content":"Not Kickstarter, Backerkit. Apparently, they're getting into the full crowdfunding business now, not just managing others' crowdfunding platforms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T12:10:58-07:00","id":1495175,"title":"","content":"Nearly hit the basic funding goal after less then 2 hours.<br /> <br /> Edit: Goal has been hit after about 2 and a half hours from campaign start.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","user":"Mizu","date":". 10-18-2022, 04:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T13:02:17-07:00","id":1495180,"title":"","content":"I'm in. <br /> <br /> Now I hope they do books for the more popular Pantheons. Admittedly, the less well known pantheons could become far more playable with a good book. But these things must be financed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T13:07:51-07:00","id":1495182,"title":"","content":"I've been out of loop for a bit on things - do we know what the pantheons in the book are?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T13:28:32-07:00","id":1495186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ardenty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1495172-scion-god-crowdfunding-now-live-on-backerkit?p=1495182#post1495182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been out of loop for a bit on things - do we know what the pantheons in the book are?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Filipino, Phoenician, Mayan, Buddhist, and Taino pantheons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T16:28:39-07:00","id":1495201,"title":"","content":"So, kind of not sold on the addition of at will (and completely free) bodily alteration for characters that is retroactively added to the list of what hero and demigod characters can do. For starters, that is already a theoi power. Granted they do also have the power to transform others but thats still cutting away part of their unique pantheon shtick. And then if you do it that definitely seems like something that should have a cost, especially if you are a hero or a demigod who is trying to force regular run of the mill mortal flesh to change instead of just magical and malleable ichor like a full god's body is made solely of. Lastly, why is this ability to alter your body limited to just changing your sex? Why are they not able to change other things about themselves they may want to change to match their self-image?<br /> <br /> I'd recommend just sticking to 'at visitation you gain self-affirming body alterations' and ditch the 'heroes and demigods can change their form at will and for free' aspect completely. Leave the ability to alter your own form as a power you have to specifically spec into just like every other supernatural manifestation of your character's legend. Or if you really want it in at least give it a cost instead of making something that useful a free to use.<br /> <br /> Edit: We have hit the first stretch goal!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","user":"Mizu","date":". 10-18-2022, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T18:42:35-07:00","id":1495209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1495172-scion-god-crowdfunding-now-live-on-backerkit?p=1495201#post1495201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd recommend just sticking to 'at visitation you gain self-affirming body alterations' and ditch the 'heroes and demigods can change their form at will and for free' aspect completely. Leave the ability to alter your own form as a power you have to specifically spec into just like every other supernatural manifestation of your character's legend. Or if you really want it in at least give it a cost instead of making something that useful a free to use.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you in regards to Heroes, but I think at the Demigod stage there's enough Ichor in a Scion's veins to make them more malleable in terms of body.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T06:52:22-07:00","id":1495239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1495172-scion-god-crowdfunding-now-live-on-backerkit?p=1495201#post1495201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, kind of not sold on the addition of at will (and completely free) bodily alteration for characters that is retroactively added to the list of what hero and demigod characters can do. For starters, that is already a theoi power. Granted they do also have the power to transform others but thats still cutting away part of their unique pantheon shtick. And then if you do it that definitely seems like something that should have a cost, especially if you are a hero or a demigod who is trying to force regular run of the mill mortal flesh to change instead of just magical and malleable ichor like a full god's body is made solely of. Lastly, why is this ability to alter your body limited to just changing your sex? Why are they not able to change other things about themselves they may want to change to match their self-image?<br /> <br /> I'd recommend just sticking to 'at visitation you gain self-affirming body alterations' and ditch the 'heroes and demigods can change their form at will and for free' aspect completely. Leave the ability to alter your own form as a power you have to specifically spec into just like every other supernatural manifestation of your character's legend. Or if you really want it in at least give it a cost instead of making something that useful a free to use.<br /> <br /> Edit: We have hit the first stretch goal!</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there something in the God announcement where this came up? I'm not sure why this is in this thread.<br /> <br /> My understanding is that the ruling about heroes being able to change their bodies came in response to someone making a custom Knack for changing sex/gender. Basically the developers were saying that trans* characters don't need special magic powers to be their authentic self. This is different from the free Metamorphosis power because that power lets you disguise, not express, your authentic self. (It's also different from the lover Knack fluid appeal because that makes subtle changes based off the desire of the other, not based on your self understanding). It's also different from the Metamorphosis boons because they let you transform yourself or another into a shape based on your Purviews, which is much broader.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24383,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24383-laughinggull","user":"LaughingGull","date":".  Hit post before proof reading 10-19-2022, 09:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24383-laughinggull","name":"LaughingGull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24383_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T14:33:34-07:00","id":1495269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LaughingGull</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1495172-scion-god-crowdfunding-now-live-on-backerkit?p=1495239#post1495239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is there something in the God announcement where this came up? I'm not sure why this is in this thread.<br /> <br /> My understanding is that the ruling about heroes being able to change their bodies came in response to someone making a custom Knack for changing sex/gender. Basically the developers were saying that trans* characters don't need special magic powers to be their authentic self. This is different from the free Metamorphosis power because that power lets you disguise, not express, your authentic self. (It's also different from the lover Knack fluid appeal because that makes subtle changes based off the desire of the other, not based on your self understanding). It's also different from the Metamorphosis boons because they let you transform yourself or another into a shape based on your Purviews, which is much broader.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this thread not also for discussion of the previews as they are released? If not I can go make a separate topic but usually threads like this include discussion of the preview material.<br /> <br /> <br /> I still think its not a good idea, I think Exalted 3rd edition had it right with the Lunar exalted and their shapeshifting. On Exaltation they get transformed into a body that matches their ideal self but if they want to transform at will thats a supernatural power they have to get with a very minor buy in of an entry level charm its impossible for your character to fail to qualify for. And in consideration of the fact that being able to change your form at will is a powerful effect for someone that wants to disguise themselves and sneak around the power did for balance reasons have an essence cost to using it instead of being free of charge. I think that would be the best way to handle it if they are intent on such a feature, self-affirming change on visitation and introduce a new universal knack people can take if they feel like magically altering their form is important to their character concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","user":"Mizu","date":". 10-19-2022, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T16:11:38-07:00","id":1495282,"title":"","content":"Personally I love the idea that genderfluid Scions can start messing around with biological sex from Hero tier. I don't need it fast or to look vastly different, both of those probably should cost XP, but I don't see why I should be locked into this 'set gender' thing just because I don't also want the ability to change my other physical features.<br /> <br /> I don't really think it steps on the toes of the Theoi that much. How many people were really going with them just to fuck about with gender. I can see an argument for maybe locking it behind a knack, but I'd personally rather it not be.<br /> <br /> Sometimes I want to be a son of Nauda with a magic prosthetic hand, sometimes I want to be a daughter of Nauda with a magic prosthetic hand, and sometimes I want to be neither while keeping the magic prosthetic hand. Plus if you think groups won't be using these rules as licence to mess about with gender at the Origin level, well I guess you don't play in the same kind of groups that I do. Although to be fair groups are probably doing it already anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T16:26:29-07:00","id":1495283,"title":"","content":"Theoi PSP is extremely flexible, to the point you can turn into a thought or a soft breeze.<br /> <br /> Changing gender would be less than a boom and have little to no effect in the game rules. Like, what is the big difference between a cis woman and a trans woman? A womb? Are you planing to get your character pregnant? Probably not, so no big, and even so, I would say a Hero could get pregnant no matter the gender just because myths are crazy. If it\u2019s your fate to be pregnant, you can carry your baby in your mind or your calves, or whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T16:35:39-07:00","id":1495284,"title":"","content":"My objection is mostly from a balance perspective over how useful it is to be a freebie that further doesn't even cost any resources to cast (alongside a little bit of thinking it is kinda clunky from an in setting perspective that for some reason their ability to alter their form is limited solely to sexual characteristics).<br /> <br /> Another alternative that might work, remove the bit where it is possible to use it to increase the difficulty of people recognizing you. If it is about making yourself the truest and most you self you can possibly be then make it so that your essence of self is instantly recognizable to anyone that would recognize you normally. That way there are no mechanical benefits to worry about balancing around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T17:00:15-07:00","id":1495285,"title":"","content":"You can stay that, even changing gender you are still recognizable, like if you gain weight or change your hair, but still people know who you are. People will recognize you are different, but still know you are you.<br /> <br /> Theoi can be really different if wanted, but it\u2019s because of the PSP innate power, not the gender change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T17:52:21-07:00","id":1495288,"title":"","content":"I mostly read it as being useful at the lower levels, but by the time you're a God it's no longer the most useful tool, and for a lot of small reasons, it's relatively painless.<br /> <br /> Of course, I admit I'm coming at it like that because it's been a while since i've looked at the powers, and I would probably honestly just allow for at least basic genderswapping* as early as Hero unless the group wanted to make a journey out of it-it's not enough of a thing for me to really bat an eye at.<br /> <br /> *now of course, I'm jumping over a lot of other idealization of form by reducing it to that, but again, while since I read the powers and I don't want to casting too much aspersions on the power differential without that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T18:16:25-07:00","id":1495290,"title":"","content":"I look at it a bit like this. A God Can look how they please (Gods doing that is a thing across multiple pantheons), so no biggy. I'll be curious about the rest of the material","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-20T00:03:38-07:00","id":1495304,"title":"","content":"We have hit 70K, yay for more expansion to the god companion book!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-21T19:51:16-07:00","id":1495402,"title":"","content":"An Anunna reformist like the one seen in the fiction seems like a really fun concept","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-22T02:06:39-07:00","id":1495407,"title":"","content":"One thing I like about this version of Scion: God is the way it takes the \u201cyou're taking charge\u201d theme up a notch, by including advice on having the god's player serve as a substitute Storyguide for things pertaining to what that God is trying to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T09:29:21-08:00","id":1496602,"title":"","content":"So I really like how OPP is trying to approach all of these mythologies respectfully and from the perspective of an insider, or trying to give an outsider an idea what an insider\u2019s view is like. And I like how responsible they are about always acknowledging the unfortunate parts of history and cautioning against common cultural appropriation ideas that boil down to \u2018brown people can\u2019t be awesome, only white people can be awesome\u2019. But then there\u2019s this bit in the Chapter 4 preview:<br /> <br /> Myths that are vital to real-world religions should be treated delicately. Likewise, attributing historical atrocities to the actions of a God by, for example, *making Hern\u00e1n Cort\u00e9s a Scion of Quetzalcoatl*, is best avoided.<br /> <br /> I REALLY like the way they kind of own up to how the treatment of the Teotl as the \u2018token evil teammate\u2019 of 1st Edition was\u2026 not very well done, and that they both did a much better job with them in 2e but make a point of cautioning against the kind of mistakes they made in 1e, calling out one of the more egregious ones very specifically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25249-deathbyflossing","name":"deathbyflossing","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}